Module path is github.com/tannernicol/restoregap, not the private Gitea home.

This is the PUBLIC OSS export staging tree. The module path is the import path
consumers write once the tool is published, so it must not follow the private
git host. Changing it to match the internal repo would break every downstream
import at the moment of publication — the one time it matters.

Vanity path restoregap.com deferred 2026-08-07 (domain owned, no landing page
yet); module moved to the GitHub path the same day. Recorded in
infra-config/gitea/layout.tsv.
